        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion A2 Contemporary Stainless Steel Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDouble cylinder, this stainless steel deadbolt features heavy duty security. A Fusion made deadbolt, it emulates the style of Miami that is both chic and streamlined. <b>Brushed stainless steel  finish</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Stainless Steel Fusion A2 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Stainless Steel Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-3/8\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder</b> - The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is  discontinued. See availablele  <a href=\"/collections/deadbolts\">Deadbolts</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
